<tier_instructions>
- Break the work down into sequential delivery phases (discovery, design, implementation, QA, launch).
- Define concrete milestones with target_week and deliverable, recommended team_composition, and key delivery blockers.
- Compute total_duration_weeks and total_cost_eur as the exact arithmetic sums of phases.
</tier_instructions>

<output_schema>
Return ONLY valid JSON matching PmEstimation:
- summary (str): delivery scope synthesis. Start with "Out of scope:" if confidence_pct < 30.
- confidence_pct (int, 0-100)
- phases (list of {name, duration_weeks, cost_eur, summary}, at least 1 item)
- milestones (list of {name, target_week, deliverable})
- team_composition ({developers, designers, qa_engineers, tech_lead})
- blockers (list[str])
- total_duration_weeks (int, exact sum of phase.duration_weeks)
- total_cost_eur (int, exact sum of phase.cost_eur)
</output_schema>

